      { "text": "Order an MRI of the brain to rule out CNS infection before antibiotics.", "explanation": "Incorrect. Imaging delays must not delay antibiotic administration in a febrile asplenic patient. This would be the correct answer if asking about workup of focal neurologic deficits in a stable patient." },
      { "text": "Start oral azithromycin and arrange next-day pediatric clinic follow-up.", "explanation": "Incorrect. Oral antibiotics are insufficient for empiric coverage of overwhelming sepsis risk in functional asplenia. This would be the correct answer for a stable outpatient with mild atypical pneumonia." }
