      { "text": "Initiate empiric recombinant factor VIII concentrate.", "explanation": "Incorrect. The pattern (prolonged PT) is not isolated to factor VIII deficiency and points to vitamin K deficiency. This would be the correct answer if the patient had isolated prolonged PTT and a positive family history of hemophilia A." }
